---
import Layout from '~/layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  metadata={{
    title: 'About | DELVINTA Technologies',
    description:
      'DELVINTA Technologies specializes in laboratory integration, connecting clinical systems, diagnostic instruments, middleware, automation, and laboratory workflows.',
  }}
>
  <!-- HERO -->
  <section class="delvinta-section pt-16 md:pt-24">
    <div class="delvinta-container">
      <div class="max-w-4xl">
        <div class="delvinta-eyebrow">About DELVINTA</div>

        <h1 class="delvinta-heading mt-6">Built around laboratory integration.</h1>

        <p class="delvinta-body mt-7 max-w-2xl">
          DELVINTA Technologies helps laboratories connect the systems, instruments, middleware, and automation that
          keep diagnostic workflows moving.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- WHY DELVINTA -->
  <section class="delvinta-section bg-[var(--delvinta-light)]">
    <div class="delvinta-container">
      <div class="grid gap-12 lg:grid-cols-[0.8fr_1.2fr] lg:gap-20">
        <div>
          <div class="delvinta-eyebrow">Why DELVINTA</div>

          <h2 class="delvinta-heading-small mt-4">Integration is our focus.</h2>
        </div>

        <div class="space-y-6">
          <p class="delvinta-body">
            Modern laboratories depend on an increasingly complex network of clinical systems, instruments, middleware,
            automation, and interfaces.
          </p>

          <p class="delvinta-body">
            DELVINTA focuses on the technical layer connecting those technologies. We bring specialized laboratory
            integration experience to implementation, conversion, support, and optimization.
          </p>

          <p class="delvinta-body">
            Our goal is straightforward: make laboratory technology work together reliably so laboratory teams can focus
            on the work that matters most.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- DIFFERENTIATORS -->
  <section class="delvinta-section">
    <div class="delvinta-container">
      <div class="max-w-3xl">
        <div class="delvinta-eyebrow">What Sets Us Apart</div>

        <h2 class="delvinta-heading-small mt-4">Specialized by design.</h2>

        <p class="delvinta-body mt-5">
          DELVINTA is intentionally focused on the intersection of laboratory operations and healthcare technology.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-10 grid gap-5 md:grid-cols-3">
        <article class="delvinta-card">
          <div class="delvinta-capability-tag">01</div>

          <h3 class="mt-5 text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-[var(--delvinta-navy)]">Deep Technical Focus</h3>

          <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-6 text-[var(--delvinta-slate)]">
            Specialized knowledge of laboratory interfaces, middleware, instruments, automation, and clinical systems.
          </p>
        </article>

        <article class="delvinta-card">
          <div class="delvinta-capability-tag">02</div>

          <h3 class="mt-5 text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-[var(--delvinta-navy)]">Laboratory First</h3>

          <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-6 text-[var(--delvinta-slate)]">
            Technology decisions are grounded in laboratory workflows, operational realities, and the people who use
            them.
          </p>
        </article>

        <article class="delvinta-card">
          <div class="delvinta-capability-tag">03</div>

          <h3 class="mt-5 text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-[var(--delvinta-navy)]">Built to Evolve</h3>

          <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-6 text-[var(--delvinta-slate)]">
            We help laboratories establish an integration foundation that can support new technologies, workflows, and
            systems over time.
          </p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- VISION -->
  <section class="pb-20 md:pb-24">
    <div class="delvinta-container">
      <div class="delvinta-cta px-6 py-12 sm:px-10 md:px-14 md:py-16">
        <div class="relative z-10 max-w-3xl">
          <div class="delvinta-kicker">Looking Ahead</div>

          <h2 class="mt-4 text-3xl font-bold leading-tight tracking-tight text-white md:text-4xl">
            Building technology around the laboratory.
          </h2>

          <p class="mt-5 max-w-2xl text-base leading-7 text-white/65">
            DELVINTA is being built to become a technology partner for laboratories—connecting the systems, devices, and
            workflows that enable modern diagnostics.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CTA -->
  <section class="delvinta-section border-t border-[var(--delvinta-border)]">
    <div class="delvinta-container">
      <div class="grid gap-8 md:grid-cols-[1fr_auto] md:items-end">
        <div>
          <div class="delvinta-eyebrow">Let's Talk</div>

          <h2 class="delvinta-heading-small mt-4">Have a laboratory integration challenge?</h2>

          <p class="delvinta-body mt-5">Let's discuss where DELVINTA can help.</p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <a href="mailto:hello@delvinta.com" class="delvinta-button delvinta-button-primary"> Talk to DELVINTA </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
